{
  "_comment": [
    "Cross-engine parity contract for the text-clip shadow/border bounding-box math.",
    "Single source of truth shared by BOTH engines:",
    "  - web:    computeTextLayoutMetrics() in src/utils/video-editor/text-layout.ts",
    "  - native: build_text_layer() in src-tauri/src/monitor/scene/build/layer_builder.rs",
    "Each engine has a test that reads this file and asserts it reproduces every case.",
    "",
    "Every case sets an explicit width/height large enough to dominate the",
    "text-measured auto frame size, so `frameWidth`/`frameHeight` are pinned",
    "independent of font-metric differences (browser Canvas2D vs. parley). This",
    "isolates the part of the layout math that IS expected to match exactly:",
    "the border/shadow bounding-box arithmetic (shadow extent = blur*1.5 + spread,",
    "offset by shadowOffsetX/Y, plus the border ring on all sides).",
    "",
    "All shadow/border magnitudes here are whole pixels at renderScale=1 (scene",
    "size == design base 1920x1080) so web's per-component `Math.round()` is a",
    "no-op and cannot diverge from native's un-rounded f32 arithmetic.",
    "",
    "frameX/frameY = the offset of the frame's top-left inside the padded",
    "background box, i.e. `borderWidth + shadowLeft` / `borderWidth + shadowTop`."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no_shadow_no_border",
      "text": "Hi",
      "style": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200,
        "fontSize": 24,
        "padding": 0
      },
      "expected": {
        "frameWidth": 300,
        "frameHeight": 200,
        "shadowLeft": 0,
        "shadowTop": 0,
        "shadowRight": 0,
        "shadowBottom": 0,
        "backgroundWidth": 300,
        "backgroundHeight": 200,
        "frameX": 0,
        "frameY": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "border_only",
      "text": "Hi",
      "style": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200,
        "fontSize": 24,
        "padding": 0,
        "borderEnabled": true,
        "borderWidth": 6
      },
      "expected": {
        "frameWidth": 300,
        "frameHeight": 200,
        "shadowLeft": 0,
        "shadowTop": 0,
        "shadowRight": 0,
        "shadowBottom": 0,
        "backgroundWidth": 312,
        "backgroundHeight": 212,
        "frameX": 6,
        "frameY": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "background_shadow_only_asymmetric_offset",
      "text": "Hi",
      "style": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200,
        "fontSize": 24,
        "padding": 0,
        "backgroundShadowEnabled": true,
        "backgroundShadowBlur": 10,
        "backgroundShadowSpread": 4,
        "backgroundShadowOffsetX": 6,
        "backgroundShadowOffsetY": -8
      },
      "expected": {
        "frameWidth": 300,
        "frameHeight": 200,
        "shadowLeft": 13,
        "shadowTop": 27,
        "shadowRight": 25,
        "shadowBottom": 11,
        "backgroundWidth": 338,
        "backgroundHeight": 238,
        "frameX": 13,
        "frameY": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "text_shadow_and_border",
      "text": "Hi",
      "style": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200,
        "fontSize": 24,
        "padding": 0,
        "borderEnabled": true,
        "borderWidth": 4,
        "textShadowEnabled": true,
        "textShadowBlur": 6,
        "textShadowSpread": 2,
        "textShadowOffsetX": 3,
        "textShadowOffsetY": 0
      },
      "expected": {
        "frameWidth": 300,
        "frameHeight": 200,
        "shadowLeft": 8,
        "shadowTop": 11,
        "shadowRight": 14,
        "shadowBottom": 11,
        "backgroundWidth": 330,
        "backgroundHeight": 230,
        "frameX": 12,
        "frameY": 15
      }
    }
  ]
}
